	<key>readme</key>
	<string># Settings — macOS System Settings Search

## Usage
Type `system` followed by a space and a search term:
- `system batt` → Battery
- `system wifi` → Wi‑Fi
- `system 电池` → Battery
- `system login` → Login Items &amp; Extensions
- `system ` (empty query) → show all 45 panes

## Features
- Search all macOS System Settings panes by English name, Chinese name, or pinyin
- ⌘↵ to copy the bundle identifier
- Press ⌘⇧, to trigger via hotkey (configurable)
- Pane list auto-discovered and cached for 24 hours</string>
